        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International BP-384, Ornate Ribbon and Reed Backplate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe really love the Ornate Edge Cabinet Pull Rosette because it can add beautiful detailing to any cabinet with a 3 inch or a 3-1/2 inch center to center. It is the small details that really elevate a house into a gorgeous home and this ribbon and reed backplate is sure to add the extra wow factor that will captivate anyone who sees them. It is available in 6 finishes and two sizes.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTo be used with matching: <a href=\"/products/french-colonial-ribbon-and-reed-cabinet-door-pull-rk-international-cp-856\"><b>Ribbon and Reed Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n or <a href=\"/products/ribbon-and-reed-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-853\"><b>French Colonial Ribbon and Reed Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<b>BP-384</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For use with cabinet pulls with a 3 inch c.c</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 7-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BP-385</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For use with cabinet pulls with a 3-1/2 inch c.c</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 7-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
